          style="rounded=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666;opacity=40;">
          <mxGeometry x="998" y="60" width="636" height="1030" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="flow-title" parent="1" value="KEY DATA FLOWS" vertex="1"
          style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;">
          <mxGeometry x="998" y="64" width="636" height="24" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- Flow 1: Country click -->
        <mxCell id="f1-bg" parent="1" value="" vertex="1"
          style="rounded=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;opacity=50;">
          <mxGeometry x="1008" y="96" width="616" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="f1-title" parent="1" value="① Country Click Flow" vertex="1"
          style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontStyle=1;fontSize=11;">
          <mxGeometry x="1016" y="100" width="300" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="f1-steps" parent="1" value="1. App mount → GET /api/countries → MapLibre paints interactive countries (fill-color by id)&#xa;2. User clicks country shape on map → MapLibre fires 'click' event with feature properties&#xa;3. MapContainer: looks up countryId from loaded list → setSelectedCountryId(id) + setIsPanelOpen(true)&#xa;4. CountryPanel reacts to MapContext change → useCountryData fires 3 parallel fetches:&#xa;     GET /api/countries/:id         → country name, lat/lng&#xa;     GET /api/countries/:id/soldiers → cursor-paginated list (limit 20)&#xa;     GET /api/countries/:id/events   → all events for country&#xa;5. CountryPanel renders list view: event cards (gold band) + soldier cards (navy band)&#xa;6. Click soldier card → view='soldier', fetches GET /api/soldiers/:id → SoldierDetail inline&#xa;7. Click event card  → view='event',   fetches GET /api/events/:id   → EventDetail inline&#xa;8. ‹ Back button returns to list view (no refetch)" vertex="1"
          style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontSize=9;verticalAlign=top;">
          <mxGeometry x="1016" y="122" width="600" height="166" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- Flow 2: Timeline click -->
        <mxCell id="f2-bg" parent="1" value="" vertex="1"
          style="rounded=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;opacity=50;">
          <mxGeometry x="1008" y="306" width="616" height="144" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="f2-title" parent="1" value="② Timeline Event Click Flow" vertex="1"
          style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontStyle=1;fontSize=11;">
          <mxGeometry x="1016" y="310" width="300" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="f2-steps" parent="1" value="1. TimelineSidebar mounts → useTimeline → GET /api/events?sort=date_asc&amp;limit=50&#xa;2. Events grouped by year (useMemo), rendered as accordion&#xa;3. User expands a year → yearEvents rendered as buttons&#xa;4. User clicks an event:&#xa;     a. mapRef.current.flyTo({ center: [lng, lat], zoom: 5, duration: 1400 })&#xa;     b. setSelectedSoldierId(null)   ← closes any open Soldier panel first&#xa;     c. setSelectedEventId(event.id) ← MapContext update&#xa;5. MapPage sees selectedEventId → mounts &lt;EventSidePanel eventId={id} /&gt;&#xa;6. EventSidePanel fetches GET /api/events/:id → renders dossier detail" vertex="1"
          style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontSize=9;verticalAlign=top;">
          <mxGeometry x="1016" y="330" width="600" height="112" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- Flow 3: Search -->
        <mxCell id="f3-bg" parent="1" value="" vertex="1"
          style="rounded=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;opacity=50;">
          <mxGeometry x="1008" y="460" width="616" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="f3-title" parent="1" value="③ Live Search Dropdown Flow" vertex="1"
          style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontStyle=1;fontSize=11;">
          <mxGeometry x="1016" y="464" width="300" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="f3-steps" parent="1" value="1. User types ≥2 chars in SearchBar (autoComplete=off — no browser history dropdown)&#xa;2. Debounce timer (350 ms) fires → GET /api/search?q=&lt;term&gt;&amp;limit=4&#xa;3. SearchService runs 3 queries in Promise.all:&#xa;     • Soldiers: plainto_tsquery on search_vector_en + search_vector_he&#xa;     • Events:   same tsvector approach with countries JOIN&#xa;     • Countries: ILIKE '%q%' on name_en + name_he&#xa;4. Dropdown renders groups: SOLDIERS / EVENTS / COUNTRIES (up to 4 each)&#xa;5a. Click Soldier → setSelectedEventId(null) + setSelectedSoldierId(id) + navigate('/map')&#xa;       MapPage mounts &lt;SoldierSidePanel&gt; → GET /api/soldiers/:id → SoldierDetail&#xa;5b. Click Event   → setSelectedSoldierId(null) + setSelectedEventId(id) + navigate('/map')&#xa;       MapPage mounts &lt;EventSidePanel&gt; → GET /api/events/:id → dossier detail&#xa;5c. Click Country → flyTo + setSelectedCountryId + setIsPanelOpen(true) + navigate('/map')" vertex="1"
          style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontSize=9;verticalAlign=top;">
          <mxGeometry x="1016" y="484" width="600" height="148" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- Flow 4: Language switch -->
        <mxCell id="f4-bg" parent="1" value="" vertex="1"
          style="rounded=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;opacity=50;">
          <mxGeometry x="1008" y="650" width="616" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="f4-title" parent="1" value="④ Language Switch Flow  (Phase 8 — not yet wired)" vertex="1"
          style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontStyle=1;fontSize=11;">
          <mxGeometry x="1016" y="654" width="400" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="f4-steps" parent="1" value="1. LanguageToggle (Phase 8) calls setLanguage('he' | 'en') in LanguageContext&#xa;2. document.documentElement.dir set to 'rtl' | 'ltr'&#xa;3. Every component that reads useLanguage() re-renders:&#xa;     text fields switch between _en / _he DB columns (no refetch needed — both always fetched)&#xa;4. Any displayed AI content clears → AIContextPanel resets to idle state" vertex="1"
          style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontSize=9;verticalAlign=top;">
          <mxGeometry x="1016" y="674" width="600" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- Flow 5: AI (Phase 9) -->
        <mxCell id="f5-bg" parent="1" value="" vertex="1"
          style="rounded=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;opacity=50;">
          <mxGeometry x="1008" y="760" width="616" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="f5-title" parent="1" value="⑤ AI Context Flow  (Phase 9 — placeholder only)" vertex="1"
          style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontStyle=1;fontSize=11;">
          <mxGeometry x="1016" y="764" width="400" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="f5-steps" parent="1" value="1. 'Get AI Context' button visible in CountryPanel / EventSidePanel / SoldierSidePanel (disabled, placeholder)&#xa;2. Phase 9: click → AIContextPanel (idle → loading → result | error)&#xa;3. POST /api/ai/{country|soldier|event}/:id  { language: 'en'|'he' }&#xa;4. AIService fetches entity from DB → assembles Gemini prompt in target language&#xa;5. Gemini API call (HTTPS POST) → plain-text contextual summary&#xa;6. Panel displays text inline — AI never triggers without user click&#xa;7. Language switch → AI content clears, button resets to idle" vertex="1"
          style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontSize=9;verticalAlign=top;">
          <mxGeometry x="1016" y="784" width="600" height="88" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- Routing summary -->
        <mxCell id="routes-summary-bg" parent="1" value="" vertex="1"
          style="rounded=1;fillColor=#1a0e06;strokeColor=#b8860b;opacity=90;">
          <mxGeometry x="1008" y="890" width="616" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="routes-summary-lbl" parent="1" value="Active Routes (main.jsx)" vertex="1"
          style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontStyle=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#b8860b;">
          <mxGeometry x="1016" y="894" width="300" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="routes-summary-body" parent="1" value="/           → HomePage  (intro + 'Explore Map' CTA)&#xa;/map        → MapPage   (TimelineSidebar + MapContainer + CountryPanel + side panels)&#xa;&#xa;Removed:  /soldier/:id  /event/:id  /timeline  /search  (all replaced by map-page panels)" vertex="1"
          style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontSize=9;fontColor=#e8dcc8;verticalAlign=top;">
          <mxGeometry x="1016" y="914" width="600" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- Legend -->
        <mxCell id="legend-bg" parent="1" value="" vertex="1"
          style="rounded=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666;opacity=50;">
          <mxGeometry x="1008" y="990" width="616" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-title" parent="1" value="Legend" vertex="1"
          style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontStyle=1;fontSize=11;">
          <mxGeometry x="1016" y="994" width="100" height="18" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="leg-blue" parent="1" value="" vertex="1" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=9;"><mxGeometry x="1016" y="1016" width="16" height="14" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="leg-blue-t" parent="1" value="Browser / Database layer" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontSize=9;"><mxGeometry x="1038" y="1015" width="180" height="16" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="leg-yellow" parent="1" value="" vertex="1" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=9;"><mxGeometry x="1016" y="1036" width="16" height="14" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="leg-yellow-t" parent="1" value="Routes / API wrappers" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontSize=9;"><mxGeometry x="1038" y="1035" width="180" height="16" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="leg-red" parent="1" value="" vertex="1" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=9;"><mxGeometry x="1016" y="1056" width="16" height="14" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="leg-red-t" parent="1" value="UI Components / DB Models" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontSize=9;"><mxGeometry x="1038" y="1055" width="180" height="16" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="leg-green" parent="1" value="" vertex="1" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=9;"><mxGeometry x="1016" y="1076" width="16" height="14" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="leg-green-t" parent="1" value="Context / Services" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontSize=9;"><mxGeometry x="1038" y="1075" width="180" height="16" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="leg-purple" parent="1" value="" vertex="1" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=9;"><mxGeometry x="1230" y="1016" width="16" height="14" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="leg-purple-t" parent="1" value="Hooks / Config / Infra" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontSize=9;"><mxGeometry x="1252" y="1015" width="180" height="16" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="leg-orange" parent="1" value="" vertex="1" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=9;"><mxGeometry x="1230" y="1036" width="16" height="14" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="leg-orange-t" parent="1" value="External / AI (Phase 9)" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontSize=9;"><mxGeometry x="1252" y="1035" width="180" height="16" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

      </root>
